<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0029/tu_0014> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasLocator> <http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0029/tu_0014/locator> .
