<http://digistrucmed.org/grade-record/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0029/gr_0017> <http://digistrucmed.org/gradingSystemName> "Source strength of evidence" .
