<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0029/tu_0013> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasExtractedEntity> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0029/e_0014> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0029/e_0017> <http://digistrucmed.org/surfaceForm> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity/beta%20blockers> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/LevelOfEvidence_C-LD> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/LevelOfEvidence> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0029/tu_0008> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Dietary instruction regarding sodium intake is recommended in all patients with HF. Patients with HF and diabetes, dyslipidemia, or obesity should be given specific instructions regarding carbohydrate or caloric constraints. (Strength of Evidence = B)" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0029/e_0013> <http://digistrucmed.org/spanConfidence> "0.95"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
